摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"谁不想coding的时候急头白脸的和大肥鱼来一场紧张刺激的21点呢","id":"gh:1333930592","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-blackjack","slug":"WhiseNT/dsh-blackjack","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"谁不想coding的时候急头白脸的和大肥鱼来一场紧张刺激的21点呢"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-blackjack"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"DeepSeek-dealt **21 点 (Blackjack) for the DeepSeek Harness**. The DeepSeek model plays dealer — it d"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"eals, decides, and trash-talks as one of two selectable personas — while every round is **event-sour"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ced** into the session log, so hands replay and fork identically. One package ships both the **host "},{"id":"p3s4","text":"game service** and the **browser sidebar UI** (a dual-face bundle), installed in a single `dsh plugi"},{"id":"p3s5","text":"rvice** and the **browser sidebar UI** (a dual-face bundle), installed in a single `dsh plugin add`."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **Install status**\n> - ✅ **Complete GitHub install** (verified against `dsh web`): one package = h"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ost service + browser UI. The plugin declares both `dsh.bundle` (the host plugin row) and `dsh.clien"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"t` (the web frontend entry); once installed the host layer mounts and the client module system picks"},{"id":"p5s4","text":" the UI up into the frontend boot graph automatically.\n> - All dependencies are the **published `@de"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"epseek-ai/*` npm packages** (`0.1.0-rc.6`) — no sibling monorepo checkout, no unpublished internal p"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"i/*` npm packages** (`0.1.0-rc.6`) — no sibling monorepo checkout, no unpublished internal packages."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**Host side**"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **Two dealer personas** you pick per session (durable through `blackjack/persona` events):\n- 🐟 **大"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"肥鱼 / Big Fat Fish** — a gluttonous, lazy deep-sea fish (\"咕噜咕噜\").\n- 😼 **雌小鬼 / Brat** — a smug, cheeky"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" brat who calls you \"杂鱼\".\n- **Model-dealt decisions**: the dealer decides hit/stand through an auxil"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"iary LLM call, one visible step at a time.\n- **Cross-round memory**: the dealer's prompts carry the "},{"id":"p8s5","text":"running score and the shared chatter history.\n- **Event sourcing**: `blackjack/game-start|hit|stand|"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"dealer-hit|settle|banter|emotion|persona` are durable session events; the fold replays identically.\n"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"- **Graceful degrade**: with the LLM route absent or failing, the dealer falls back to per-persona p"},{"id":"p8s8","text":" degrade**: with the LLM route absent or failing, the dealer falls back to per-persona preset lines."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**Browser UI**"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- A 🃏 entry in the sidebar footer opens the 21 table in the right details column.\n- The table, deale"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"r-mood badge, lifetime record, a chatter feed (dealer banter plus a staggered card-flip draw animati"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"on), and an emoji quick-bar.\n- Talks to the host through a self-mounted `blackjack` Remote namespace"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"; the UI holds no game state of its own."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## UI preview"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The screenshots below come from verified `dsh web` sessions. The exact cards, dealer lines, and reco"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"rd counters vary with the session log, but they show the complete browser half: the sidebar entry, t"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"he table, the chatter feed, and the action bar."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Install (complete: host + UI)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The plugin is a dsh **dual-face bundle** (`dsh.bundle` → `cordis.patch.yml` + `dsh.client` → `lib/cl"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" is a dsh **dual-face bundle** (`dsh.bundle` → `cordis.patch.yml` + `dsh.client` → `lib/client.js`):"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"A git install fetches sources, so the first `add` needs the self-contained `prepare` build allowed o"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"nce — copy the pnpm key into the profile's `pnpm-workspace.yaml` under `allowBuilds` (see the offici"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"al publishing guide) and re-run `add`. Only allow sources you trust."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Verify and boot:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"After restarting `dsh web`, a 🃏 entry in the sidebar footer means the UI is live: the host layer sho"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ws in `--dump-config`, and the client module system automatically scans the `dsh.client` declaration"},{"id":"p19s3","text":" and weaves the UI into the frontend boot graph (`__DSH_BOOT__`) — no extra configuration."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Configuration (override in your profile's `cordis.patch.yml`):"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Gameplay"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Standard Blackjack over one deterministic 52-card deck (seed stored in the `game-start` event): Aces"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" 11/1, face cards 10, hit/stand, dealer draws to ≥17. Busts lose immediately; equal totals push."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Repo layout"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Dev: `pnpm install`, `pnpm run build`, `pnpm test` (136 tests: 92 host + 44 UI). All `@deepseek-ai/*"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"` deps are the **published** packages — no sibling monorepo checkout needed."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Tag this repository with the `dsh-plugin` topic so dsh users can find it."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
